  // Screen 08 - Gameplay, the table (GDD §11 T rules + screen 08). Rects are mockup pixels on 08-gameplay.png.
  // Shared kit: header discs and their shadows, the logo, the home / scorecard / settings icons, avatar ring
  // and avatar. Cut here (unique to the table): the name plate and the status pill (one of each, 9-sliced and
  // reused by every seat), the timer disc, the round ornaments, the trump spade, the header divider and the
  // emote and sort icons. The timer ring is a vector (it is a radial fill at runtime).
  // Cards are never nodes: the hand, the trick and the opponents' fans are built at runtime from the deck
  // sprites. Their areas are plain rects here so the plate is cleared under them and the view gets a
  // container at the measured place (SeatFan*, TrickArea, HandArea).
  // Seats are numbered by relative position (GDD T rules): 0 bottom (you), 1 right, 2 top, 3 left.
  "name": "Table",
  "mockup": "08-gameplay.png",
  "plate": {
    "generated": "ArtSource/Working/Table/BG_Table_Plate_16x9.png",
    "generatedWide": "ArtSource/Working/Table/BG_Table_Plate_Wide.png"
  },
  "nodes": [
